[{"client_msg_id":"dde73208-a012-44e2-b9f2-40d1cf826fc1","type":"message","user":"UA1GWETAA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blob/bc2e97c78ec3cf0e33b8ccc0cc2357c61640bb3c/settings/deno.vim#L23|https://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blob/bc2e97c78ec3cf0e33b8ccc0cc2357c61640bb3c/settings/deno.vim#L23\u003e","ts":"1632382344.087000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blob/bc2e97c78ec3cf0e33b8ccc0cc2357c61640bb3c/settings/deno.vim | deno.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/blob/bc2e97c78ec3cf0e33b8ccc0cc2357c61640bb3c/settings/deno.vim | deno.vim\u003e","text":"```\n      \\ 'blocklist': lsp_settings#get('deno', 'blocklist', {c-\u0026gt;empty(lsp#utils#find_nearest_parent_file_directory(lsp#utils#get_buffer_path(), 'node_modules/')) ? [] : lsp_settings#utils#warning('server \"deno\" is disabled since \"node_modules\" is found', ['typescript', 'javascript', 'typescriptreact', 'javascriptreact'])}),\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings|mattn/vim-lsp-settings\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VLrA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afd35dab-969f-46d3-b559-689d3303bf76","type":"message","user":"UA1GWETAA","text":"私はホームディレクトリにいつの間にか作られていたnode_modulesディレクトリのせいでdenoのlspが起動しないことありました。\n\nエラーメッセージが出てたので気づきましたね。","ts":"1632382214.086700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v2AWZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cbf0ae3-c7b3-47b1-80d5-64889d204eec","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"README は Vim の中から見れないので…","ts":"1632381274.080400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lqCL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20f29aee-5f66-4cee-9c25-15e2623f236a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"READMEの\n\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings#extra-configurations\u003e\nセクションに説明はあるんですが、helpにはないか...?","ts":"1632381208.080000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"mattn/vim-lsp-settings","id":1,"title":"mattn/vim-lsp-settings","text":"Auto configurations for Language Server for vim-lsp","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"750","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ln50"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad36fd87-ff3d-44db-980e-9dd1bcb6b4b1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"これ、もう古いのかな?、再確認しないと","ts":"1632381131.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"es=Kg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe7d357e-ad1f-45eb-b048-a131e4f9ad77","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ちなみに help 見たんですけど、その変数についての説明が見当たりませんでした…","ts":"1632381065.079200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aTM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85aa3950-1120-41e0-9330-c445d86cfccb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"不要なので、逆にあったらdisableになるからあったりしないかな?という意味でした、ちょっと下手でしたね","ts":"1632381054.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tD/e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91623076-d7e1-4806-813e-279086de0d99","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ありがとうございます、試してみます","ts":"1632380997.078100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y6o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a042486-1075-4f56-9669-555f073d349b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"deno はプロジェクトのファイルを見て検出するのが難しいので仕方ない感じか","ts":"1632380988.077900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"elxBM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96ff8138-3e86-4a7b-8b3c-ab02e03c7893","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"その設定が必要なのか","ts":"1632380969.077400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ieHK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b2d16e5-9ac8-4c4c-bacd-1477c0f3c881","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"deno なので node_modules は不要だと思いますが、どうなんでしょ?","ts":"1632380936.077200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m=X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a1159be-b2b0-4fab-9c5c-7e3c6ab1a140","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ようはTypeScriptのlspとしてdenoがenableになるところまでいってるか、ですかね?","ts":"1632380920.076800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MTDLk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75a74088-bc7e-4725-ad49-fad51219448f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは\n```let g:lsp_settings_filetype_typescript = ['deno', 'typescript-language-server']```\nとか?","ts":"1632380900.076400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gyQX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b99cca9-e597-41ee-b323-2e6681c878a5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"パスが通ってれば、まずinstall自体は不要な気がします。\nで、statusに出ないのは、対象になってないせいなので、node_moduleがあるとかも含めて、サーバが動く状態になってるか、が問題かもしれません。","ts":"1632380876.076100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sOB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3352071-b6c1-4c05-a882-51c864c925c1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"vim-lsp-settings で、`:LspInstallServer deno` で deno を入れても Vim を再起動すると `:LspStatus` の一覧に出なくなってしまうんですけど、何が問題でしょう?\nそもそも `deno` コマンド自体は環境に入ってるので、インストールしなくても設定だけしてほしかったりするので、その方法ももしあれば知りたいです :pray:","ts":"1632380780.075200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lpt"}]},{"client_ms